  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 20",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda sea Shaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-hadadi was sugoocheanda Shaamu ghoamughuush shirikareadaanyi aba hijagi; nea gwandeayi sea sugoodi diktam ea damaniyeenya ea faraasajeega ea mutukwajeega; hean gawa ak ghaghas Samariya, ak gang'uchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta giijasoodiga jeeda mujiini heeda Ahabuheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi Ben-hadadi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Lapiyajeega ea dahaaboadaang'u geasu gil; gadeemgaagu miyaasiin ea diibigaagu ea geasu gil.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanya ghuuta sugoocheanda Israeli, ak gwayi, “Aba gidanyaashta, ng'utamiideanyu, Ea sugoocheanda, Aniini geabeayeey, ea gilinyoo dandeawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiigu gicha giijasoodiga, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi Ben-hadadi: ‘Neajeagu headaang'u nea geayeenyi, “Goonean lapiyeadaang'u ea dahaaboadaang'u, ea gadeemga ea diibigaagu”; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gaydeajeagu fugeasu bea gadiyeeda numuji aba damani, ak gayghoasaach gheang'u ea gealga fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, ak gayghwayiin geatinga nyaawa gilinyoo ghabwariiy, ak gaygageanda.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa sugoocheanda Israeli gweargwa sean bea ng'eanyiida, ak gwayeesha, “Ooroora, ghamneawa, ghoadaayi gidagasiida siisi jaliida; aba gideaba goojeagu heedeanyu gagasa gadeemgeasu ea diibigeasu, ea lapiyeedeanyu ea dahaaboodeanyu, ak ea maweadaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha gweargwa sean, ea buuneeda sean, “Adiidu giyiinyi ghana mwasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha giijasoodiga Ben-hadadi, “Arukusiina ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, ‘Gilinyoo ghayi ng'ala siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba mwadi gaydasin, amaduuku ng'asheanji ea maydasin.’” Ghang'eat gaweay giijasoodiga goodeelsa gicha ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeaksa Ben-hadadi ak gwayeesha, “Gagasa gwahindanaan aseecheeka, ea ghwanaawa, inyas gaygabeachi birjeanda Samariya baneaguuka fuga eadu geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanya ghuuta sugoocheanda Israeli, “Ayeeshiina niny, ‘Siida akwa hang'weakaaschi bea ng'ucheeda adiidu gigwareesi nea mii goosha ng'ucheeda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Ben-hadadi ng'asheanji nea abeeda gwaleeshi sea sugoodiga aba jeeda maheemajeega, gwayeesha fugaaschi, “Ada dabiteang'wa.” Hean ghwarat dabita nyaawa ak gaweesa mujiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, ghwahidu sibaneeda murdeeda Ahabu was sugoocheanda Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Nidaahi fiisu was eemeetuwiin? Ng'ula, gaydayiin geatingaagu askwearjeanji, ak abeeda gaynala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Ahabu, “Gajea ng'eaha?” Hean gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, gaygwasin fuga gadiyeeda bea fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyoojiga.” Hean gwayeesha, “Gayghoang'eat ng'eaha ng'ucheeda?” Gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa fuga gadiyeeda bea sugoodiga hees ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida, nea ghwanyiit bughalaji iyeenya ea diktam ea damaniyeenya, ama ng'ata gaguursa fuga sean bea Israeli, fih sagalamnyooji ispwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaweay askweari, nea abeeda Ben-hadadi gwaleeshi ea gaboogit aba jeeda maheemajeega, niny sea sugoodi diktam ea damaniyeenya weetooschi niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga gadiyeeda bea sugoodiga hees ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida goosheedeawa saawa gaweay. Ak goojeakta Ben-hadadi buuneeda suuk, ak goodeelsa niny ng'asheanda gideaba, “Gwarina buuneeda Samariya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Inyas ghapka nea gweadu hoyyoo, oang'waanya nea majeekcheewi, ama inyas ghapka ng'ucheeda, ghoang'waanyi nea gudu ea majeekcheewi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabeawa jeeda mujiini, fuga gadiyeeda bea sugoodiga Israeli ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida ea lugooda eadu geeshta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaba siisi bwar siidaanyi; hean gwasalda fuga Shaamu ak ghwaat geeshta nyaawa fuga Israeli, nea Ben-hadadi was sugoocheanda Shaamu gwajagwadeada sea faraasi ea fuga ding'da faraasajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa sugoocheanda Israeli gwarita ak ghoang'waay faraasajeega ea mutukwajeega, ak ghabwar fuga Shaamu ea gwasawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweesa sibaneeda sugoocheanda Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Beeni, ahaada uurda, ak gidaahi gichea sina; aba gideaba doomeelda sugoocheanda Shaamu gayghoan ng'ucheeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheedeaba iyeenya bea fuga Shaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha fuga gadiyeeda sugoocheanda Shaamu niny, “Aseecheeka nyaawa aseecheeka heayeeniga gil, ak ea hees uurjeen ea gaburdeaweesa; ak ghamneawa nung' eeng'ucheena aba mooheeda, ak aba huumwa gajeajoara saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini ng'asheanji, geandeawana sugoodiga hoorgajeega nyaawa, ak giyiini shirikarajeega hoorgajeega nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gigwalu lugooda deena gea ghayi rooda, faraasi ea faraasi, ak mutuku ea mutuku, ak abeeda gajeeng'ucheena aba mooheeda; ak abeeda gajeeburdeawana saawa uurjeenga.” Hean gooleeysiit ng'asheega nyaawa ak gwasindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda doomeelda gagwalu Ben-hadadi fuga Shaamu, ak gawa ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida siguura Afeki, gang'uchi sea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeguursa fuga Israeli, ak geang'ata, ak gaweay gang'uchi; ak fuga Israeli gooduuw aba madeeda nyaawa nea gawuurji hawanyooji iyeenya bea nooga, nea fuga Shaamu gwadukuta ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu siida ASEETA ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Aba gideaba fuga Shaamu niyi, “NG'UTAMIIDA aseeta heayeeniga gil, nea ea mii aseeta moohajeega gil,” ak ghamneawa gaydayiin geatingaagu fiisu was eemeetuwiin, ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooduuw aba heeda fursiinyi eawooji ispwa. Ng'ata eaweedeaba ispwa ghang'eat ng'ucheeda; ak ghabwar fuga Israeli fih sagalamnyooji bughala bea Shaamu aba askwearjeanjagi was lugooda badiina geeshanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gea siipuut gwasalsa jeeda mujiineeda Afeki; ak goobeedeaysa ghamarda fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea ispwa was fugiga siipuudiin. Hean eara Ben-hadadi, ghoabita jeeda gheeda mida bugusta mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda niny, “Ng'ula ghamneawa, siyiinyi gideaba sugoodiga Israeli ea doobiiweadi; anung' eekwealsiina guniyajeega bugusuunatkaasa nea geerasi ghealooniga gheatkeakaasa, ak geeweayi heeda sugoocheanda Israeli; ghwadeaba ghabwayda eaweagaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwarat mananuunatka nyaawa aba guniyajeega, ak ghwarat gheatkweaka nyaawa aba ghealooniga, ak gaweay heeda sugoocheanda Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi Ben-hadadi was siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ‘Geamuscheey, nung' daghuhu.’” Ak gwayi, “Niny gudu gwanda? Niny orjeeda giyeanya gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda buuneeda gang'ula muuchi aba heeda miy ghaang' ak ghwalamwach gageanda ng'asheandida aba headaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Ea orjeeda giyeang'wa was Ben-hadadi.” Hean gwayeesha, “Aweayeena ayeani.” Ng'ata ghwahidu Ben-hadadi headaanyi; ak goodiing'sa uhuuda mutuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Ben-hadadi, “Mujiinajeega ghayi geanda bwaabwa aba heeda gweanu gaydaaghuumu; ak gaysisiina geaw gealga sisheahiideawa haleanjeeda aba Dameski, gawuurji gidasinda bwaabwa aba Samariya.” Ng'ata gwayeesha Ahabu, “Abeeda gaydasikseey aba neajeeni” Hean gwaneaji sea niny ak ghwanung' gawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda gwanyareeksa Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gwayeesha siyagi aba jeeda diibiga sibanga siyagi mideaydooschi aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, “Geamuscheey bwaraan.” Ak ghaheawa siidida ghabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha niny, “Asi iiniheawi aleeysiina iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA, ng'ula, inyas ging'ami heedeanyu, gayghwaaknyi ng'adiida.” Hean nea ghabeawa hoowa gwaroonyi sea ng'adiida ak ghwaak ng'adiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaroonyi sih nuut ak gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey bwaran.” Hean ghabwar siidida ea gwasawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gawa sibaneeda, ak ghoamuughu sugoocheanda aba naweeda, ak ghwayam hang'weakaaschi ea meanala ak gwarasa weasta uhuudaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghang'ata sugoocheanda, gooyeawusa sugoocheanda nea gwayeesha, “Siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gawa bugusta ng'ucheeda; ak ging'ulayi, shirikarajeanda gwayamsean geaw ak gweanean siida, ak gwayi, ‘Ng'ula siisi; inyas ghwaroat, eaweagaagu gaygawa heeda eaweagaaschi, ghana gajeawalnyi dalaanteeda lapiya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gang'uchi gil ea gil, hean ghang'eat gawa siidida.” Gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli, “Nih gichea gawuurji girgweageadaang'u gil; giidoabiiwi seabwa girgweageadaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamwach gageanda weasta mida uhuudaanyi; ak gwajeeng'u sugoocheanda Israeli gideaba gaba jeeda sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Iininung' ghabeawa geatingaagu siida ghayi eayeenyi gayghami, ak ghamneawa eaweagaagu gaygaweay heeda eaweagaaschi, nea fugaagu gaygaweay hoorgeeda fugaaschi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa sugoocheanda Israeli gheanyi nea gagiisan aba nyarasta, ak ghwahidu Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
